# Screenshot: Menu

This screenshot shows the main menu of the 3D arcade racing game. The menu displays:

- A title screen with the game name
- A car selection interface with three distinct vehicle options
- A start button to begin the race
- Control instructions for the player

The menu is designed to be intuitive and visually appealing, with clear text and distinct vehicle models. The player can select their preferred car before starting the race, with each car having different performance characteristics.

The menu also includes a pause button and a restart option, allowing the player to control the game flow. The overall design follows a clean, modern aesthetic with appropriate spacing and visual hierarchy.

This screenshot represents the initial state of the game, where the player can make their first decisions before entering the race.